{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck.md","title":"顶点细化刻画单图上的 C² 类型","display":"thm-vertex-refinement-ck — 顶点细化刻画单图上的 C² 类型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck","aliases":["29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck"],"display":"thm-vertex-refinement-ck — 顶点细化刻画单图上的 C² 类型","depends_on":["[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]","[[29-df-ck]]","[[29-df-counting-game]]","[[29-df-bijection-game]]","[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]","[[29-thm-counting-bijection]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 12.27, pp.190–191, DjVu scans 205–206","source_basis":"陈述、页面图像及证明均已核对；用分割不变量补足等号与获胜者细节"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vertex-refinement-ck — 顶点细化刻画单图上的 C² 类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4c575bb1780ff55\" href=\"?note=a4c575bb1780ff55\" title=\"29-df-vertex-refinement\">29-df-vertex-refinement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab516fb5dde9de22\" href=\"?note=ab516fb5dde9de22\" title=\"29-df-counting-game\">29-df-counting-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd\" href=\"?note=f0cbb7d365d6e3cd\" title=\"29-df-bijection-game\">29-df-bijection-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20e8f6e9b486343b\" href=\"?note=20e8f6e9b486343b\" title=\"29-thm-counting-game-ck\">29-thm-counting-game-ck</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f7769b0fc6d1261\" href=\"?note=3f7769b0fc6d1261\" title=\"29-thm-counting-bijection\">29-thm-counting-bijection</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 12.27, pp.190–191, DjVu scans 205–206"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"陈述、页面图像及证明均已核对；用分割不变量补足等号与获胜者细节"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span> 为非空有限无向简单彩色图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in|G|\">\\(u,v\\in|G|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{G,m}\">\\(\\equiv_{G,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{G,\\infty}\">\\(\\equiv_{G,\\infty}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a4c575bb1780ff55\" href=\"?note=a4c575bb1780ff55\" title=\"29-df-vertex-refinement\">29-df-vertex-refinement</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^2_{\\tau_r}\">\\(C^2_{\\tau_r}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_C\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_C\">\\(\\models_C\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,x_2\">\\(x_1,x_2\\)</span> 为不同变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 是已给定的个体变量集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_w\">\\(\\beta_w\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{u,v}\">\\(p_{u,v}\\)</span> 分别为下式构造的全赋值及只放置第一对卵石的位置。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{r,m}\">\\(\\Theta_{r,m}\\)</span> 是下式定义的至多秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的单自由变量两变量公式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_r\">\\(\\Theta_r\\)</span> 不限制量词秩。本条只比较同一图中的两个顶点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_w\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,w\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad w\\in|G|,\\qquad\np_{u,v}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_w\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,w\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad w\\in|G|,\\qquad\np_{u,v}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{r,m}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^2_{\\tau_r}:\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,x_2\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\},\\qquad\n\\Theta_r\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\Theta_{r,m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta_{r,m}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^2_{\\tau_r}:\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,x_2\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\},\\qquad\n\\Theta_r\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\Theta_{r,m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_{G,m}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left(\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_{r,m}\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v])\\right)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{C,2,m}(p_{u,v})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{B,2,m}(p_{u,v}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\equiv_{G,m}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left(\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_{r,m}\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v])\\right)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{C,2,m}(p_{u,v})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{B,2,m}(p_{u,v}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_r\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_r\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.27，印刷页190–191、扫描页205–206；陈述及证明已与页面图像核对。有限轮的第一个等价对应原书颜色相等，后两个对应计数、双射游戏；稳定式由有限公式量词秩和稳定性直接推出。这里没有将单图内两个顶点的结论推广成任意两图分别编号后颜色数字相同即可比较。</p>\n<p>颜色不同推出可区分：对轮数归纳，每个当前颜色块在这一个有限图上均有同秩的一自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^2\">\\(C^2\\)</span> 特征式。初始块由颜色谓词及其否定的合取描述；下一轮若旧颜色相同而对某旧颜色块的邻居数不同，就在其特征式外使用一次阈值计数。构造时交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,x_2\">\\(x_1,x_2\\)</span> 两个变量名，只用这两个名字；有限合取列出全部旧颜色块及其精确计数。计数精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 可写为阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 成立且阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q+1\">\\(q+1\\)</span> 不成立。这个构造不要求各颜色块在所有图上由相同特征式描述。</p>\n<p>颜色相同推出获胜：加强归纳不变量为“每对已放卵石的两个端点有相同剩余轮颜色，并且位置原子合法”。移动一对后，保留端点的同色性保证其对每个上一轮颜色块的邻居数相等；同图内总块大小相同，故非邻居数也相等。逐块、逐邻接状态配对构造双射，并特别令保留端点对应，从而同时保持相等关系。所有被选新端点的颜色降一轮后仍相同，剩余位置满足归纳不变量。没有保留卵石时取恒等双射。无向简单图的假设保证只需这些邻接与相等条件；一元颜色由初始分割保留。</p>\n<p>原书页191证明末句在页面图像上写为 Samson 获胜，和所证回应方策略矛盾，应为 Delilah；本条采用上述不变量证明得到回应方获胜。此处是原书文字笔误，不能按 OCR 原句复制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vertex-refinement","status":"resolved","id":"a4c575bb1780ff55","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-counting-game","status":"resolved","id":"ab516fb5dde9de22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bijection-game","status":"resolved","id":"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bijection-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-counting-game-ck","status":"resolved","id":"20e8f6e9b486343b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-counting-bijection","status":"resolved","id":"3f7769b0fc6d1261","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-counting-bijection]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vertex-refinement","status":"resolved","id":"a4c575bb1780ff55","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\equiv_{G,m}$、$\\equiv_{G,\\infty}$ 取 [[29-df-vertex-refinement]]；$C^2_{\\tau_r}$、$\\operatorname{vars}$、$\\operatorname{fv}$、$\\mathrm{qr}_C$、$\\models_C$ 取 [[29-df-ck]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\equiv_{G,m}$、$\\equiv_{G,\\infty}$ 取 [[29-df-vertex-refinement]]；$C^2_{\\tau_r}$、$\\operatorname{vars}$、$\\operatorname{fv}$、$\\mathrm{qr}_C$、$\\models_C$ 取 [[29-df-ck]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r=\\langle E^{(2)},C_1^{(1)},\\ldots,C_r^{(1)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in|G|","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{G,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{G,\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"C^2_{\\tau_r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_C","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,x_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_w","display":false},{"tex":"p_{u,v}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta_{r,m}","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_w\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,w\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad w\\in|G|,\\qquad\np_{u,v}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Theta_{r,m}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^2_{\\tau_r}:\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,x_2\\}\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\},\\qquad\n\\Theta_r\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\Theta_{r,m}.","display":true},{"tex":"u\\equiv_{G,m}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left(\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_{r,m}\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v])\\right)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{C,2,m}(p_{u,v})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW^{G,G}_{B,2,m}(p_{u,v}).","display":true},{"tex":"u\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Theta_r\\;\n(G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_u]\\leftrightarrow G\\models_C\\phi[\\beta_v]).","display":true},{"tex":"C^2","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,x_2","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q+1","display":false}],"bytes":4044,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]、[[29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]] — 顶点颜色细化与 C² 类型"},{"id":"531861035d8c6707","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck|29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]]"}],"outgoing":["a4c575bb1780ff55","587fa3c5f12ce89b","ab516fb5dde9de22","f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","20e8f6e9b486343b","3f7769b0fc6d1261"]}